GIT CLONE
=========

Download a repository to your computer.


THE COMMAND
-----------

git clone https://github.com/user/repo.git


WHAT HAPPENS
------------

• Creates folder named "repo"
• Downloads all files
• Sets up Git connection
• Ready to work immediately


CUSTOM NAME
-----------

git clone https://github.com/user/repo.git my-name

Creates folder "my-name" instead.


FASTER DOWNLOAD
---------------

git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/user/repo.git

Only latest version. Much faster.


AFTER CLONING
-------------

cd repo
ls
git status


ERRORS & FIXES
--------------

Repository not found?
  → Check the URL
  → Verify internet connection

Permission denied?
  → Use HTTPS (not SSH)
  → Check you have access
